== Architectural Limitation

The architecture's main limits are single points in the data tier (AISS-01, AISS-05, AISS-10), unproven capacity (AISS-12), incomplete AWS failure validation (AISS-13) and alert coverage (AISS-16). @tbl-aiss separates accepted exceptions from proposed production work and identifies the owner of each limitation.

*Roadmap.* Each open item is assigned to one phase (@tbl-roadmap). In R0 we verified placement, rebuilt the environment from nothing and reran the load tests; the verification and start-up work we did not finish moves to R1. R1 and R2 apply only if the platform continues after the course, and their dates assume a go-live decision in December 2026. The owners and dates are our proposal; nobody has committed to them yet.

